# Library of Leng applies to any spell or ability that has its controller discard, whoever controls it (the rulings), a
# random discard included ("you can look at a randomly discarded card before deciding where it goes"): Bot2's Hymn to
# Tourach takes both of Bot1's Islands, and Bot1 puts one on top of the library and lets the other go to the graveyard.
# The Library is Bot1's alone ("you discard", "your library"): Bot2's own Faithless Looting discards Bot2's cards into
# Bot2's graveyard, and neither player is asked anything.
